      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "第32小节"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "666",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "666．把下列各式写成$3^n$或者$-3^n$的形式（$n\\in N$）：",
        "а）$(-3^3)^2$；　б）$(-3^2)^3$；　в）$-(3^4)^2$；　г）$-(-3^2)^3$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "667",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "667．不作计算，在点号处填上符号$<$、$>$或$=$，使所得到的是",
        "真命题：",
        "а）$(-1.75)^5\\ldots(-0.29)^2$；　б）$(-36)^7\\ldots(-2.1)^6$；",
        "в）$0.98^6\\ldots1.02^3$；　г）$\\left(\\frac{5}{6}\\right)^9\\ldots\\left(\\frac{6}{5}\\right)^2$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "668",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "668．化简：",
        "а）$(x^3)^2\\cdot(-x^3)^4$；　б）$(-y^3)^7\\cdot(-y^4)^5$；",
        "в）$(x^m)^5\\cdot(-x^2)^6$；　г）$(-c^k)^4\\cdot(c^5)^2$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "669",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "669．把下列各数表示成指数不等于1的幂的形式，有多少种",
        "不同的表示方法？",
        "а）$2^{15}$；　б）$2^6$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "670",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "670．用一个式子代替$p$，使所得的等式对于变量取任何值时",
        "都是真等式：",
        "а）$p^5=x^{20}$；　б）$p^7=-b^{35}$；",
        "в）$p^3c^8=-c^{20}$；　г）$y^7\\cdot(y^2)^4=p^5$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "671",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "671．把下列各式写成幂的形式：",
        "а）$4^5\\cdot2^{21}$；　б）$5^{13}\\cdot25^{11}$；　в）$8^5\\cdot16^3$；　г）$27^{10}\\cdot9^{15}$．"
      ]
    },
